<view class="studio">
  <text class="eyebrow">OPENING SEVEN / 05</text>
  <text class="title">这手留不留</text>
  <view class="subtitle">先做决定，再看看另一种思路。</view>
  <picker
    range="{{questions}}"
    range-key="title"
    value="{{index}}"
    bindchange="select"
  >
    <view class="panel row between">
      <text>{{index + 1}} / {{questions.length}}　{{hand.title}}</text>
      <text>▾</text>
    </view>
  </picker>
  <view class="section-title section">{{hand.commander}}</view>
  <view class="subtitle">{{hand.context}}</view>
  <view class="hand-list">
    <view wx:for="{{hand.cards}}" wx:key="*this" class="hand-card">
      <text class="hand-number">{{index + 1}}</text>
      <text class="card-name">{{item}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  <community-poll
    poll-id="{{'hand:' + hand.id}}"
    choices="{{choices}}"
    bindanswer="reveal"
  />
  <button wx:if="{{!revealed}}" class="link" bindtap="reveal">
    直接查看讨论思路
  </button>
  <view wx:if="{{revealed}}" class="section">
    <view class="panel">
      <view class="section-title">如果保留</view>
      <view class="subtitle">{{hand.keep}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="panel">
      <view class="section-title">如果调度</view>
      <view class="subtitle">{{hand.mull}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="notice">
      这是讨论题，不设唯一标准答案。桌面信息、套牌构成与调度次数都会改变选择。
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="actions">
    <button bindtap="practice">去套牌试玩练习</button>
    <button open-type="share">和朋友讨论</button>
  </view>
</view>
